\nParents & Families\nMedia\nRequest Info\nApply\nVisit\nGive\nClose Search Menu\nLet Us Help\nSearch\nSearch\nScholarships & Financial Aid\nHome\nAdmission & Aid\nScholarships & Financial Aid\nAdmission & Aid\nUndergraduate Admission\nGraduate Admission\nInternational Admission\nScholarships & Financial Aid\nTuition & Fees\nProfessional & Continuing Studies\nPre-College & Dual Enrollment\nMilitary & Veterans\nAdmission & Aid\nUndergraduate Admission\nGraduate Admission\nInternational Admission\nScholarships & Financial Aid\nTuition & Fees\nProfessional & Continuing Studies\nPre-College & Dual Enrollment\nMilitary & Veterans\nFinancial Support for Your Education\nA Catholic University education is a wise investment. Need-based and merit-based scholarships, student loans, and federal student aid are all part of making that investment fit your budget. As you work through the application process for admission, you can also begin securing financial aid.\nThe University's Office of Student Financial Assistance is committed to helping you determine your options and secure a financial path that's right for you.\nUndergraduate Financial Aid\nLearn everything you need to know about scholarships, grants, and other financial aid options available for undergraduate students.\nLearn More\nGraduate Financial Aid\nOur Office of Student Financial Assistance can provide you with information about scholarships, grants, and other financial aid options available for graduate students.\nLearn More\nStart With Your Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA)\nFinancial aid packages and loan programs are calculated based on each student\u2019s need. You must fill out the FAFSA each year to determine how much you will receive in financial aid awards and calculate your family\u2019s estimated contribution. The FAFSA also determines eligibility for student loans and the work study program. For quick reference, our FAFSA school code is 001437. Catholic University does not require or review the CSS Profile.\nDetails about the FAFSA\nCalculate Your Costs\nReview the cost of attendance and find resources to help you plan ahead.\nMore about Tuition & Fees\nReady for the Next Step?\nApply Today\nContact the Financial Aid Team\nRequest Info\nRequest Info\nApply\nVisit\nGive\nAthletics\nCardinal Shop\nLibraries\nDirectory\nCareers\nFor Media\nCopyright & Trademark\nPrivacy\nPolicies\nConsumer Information\nEn Espa\u00f1ol\nDisability Support\nReport Misconduct\nCompliance\nSite footer logo\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nLinkedIn\n620 Michigan Ave., N.E.\nWashington, DC 20064\n(202) 319-5000\nContact Us & Directions\nSupport the University\nMake a gift to Catholic University\n\u00a9 1887-2026\nThe Catholic University of America", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://www.catholic.edu/admission-aid/scholarships-financial-aid#main-content"], ["", "https://www.catholic.edu/admission-aid/scholarships-financial-aid"], ["Newsroom", "https://www.catholic.edu/news-events"], ["Athletics", "https://catholicathletics.com/"], ["Virtual Tour", "https://www.catholic.edu/virtual-tour"], ["En Espa\u00f1ol", "https://www.catholic.edu/en-espanol"], ["Info For", "https://www.catholic.edu/admission-aid/scholarships-financial-aid"], ["Current Students", "https://www.catholic.edu/current-students"], ["Faculty & Staff", "https://www.catholic.edu/faculty-staff"], ["Alumni", "https://engage.catholic.edu/alumni"], ["Parents & Families", "https://www.catholic.edu/parents-families"], ["Media", "https://www.catholic.edu/information-media"], ["Request Info", "https://www.catholic.edu/request-info"], ["Apply", "https://www.catholic.edu/apply"], ["Visit", "https://www.catholic.edu/visit"], ["Give", "https://engage.catholic.edu/giving"], ["Search", "https://www.catholic.edu/admission-aid/scholarships-financial-aid#site-header-search-menu"], ["Catholic University", "https://www.catholic.edu/"], ["Toggle Menu", "https://www.catholic.edu/admission-aid/scholarships-financial-aid#site-hea